        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">The price depends on the volume and weight of goods, distance (approximately 880 km), type of packaging required, vehicle size (18‑ft, 22‑ft, or 32‑ft containers), any special handling for fragile or high‑value items, and optional insurance coverage. Seasonal demand and fuel surcharge also affect the final quote.</p>
