      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What insurance coverage is included for goods shipped between Delhi and Indore?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">All moves include IRDAI‑approved marine transit insurance covering up to 100 % of the declared value of your items. For high‑value electronics or antiques, you can opt for additional coverage. The policy protects against loss, theft, or damage during loading, transit, and unloading.</p>
